 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "TaskScheduler() starts empty. addTask(id, dependencies) adds a task whose prerequisites are the listed ids (distinct; they may name tasks not added yet). It returns false and changes nothing when id was already added or when the new task would close a dependency cycle (including depending on itself); otherwise true. getExecutionOrder() returns every added task that can run, i.e. whose prerequisites are all added and can run, in the topological order that always picks the smallest id (by code point) among the tasks whose prerequisites are already listed. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk11-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
